contentText:
Travis Scott is riding high after starring in Christopher Nolan&#8217;s The Odyssey . La Flame&#8217;s winning streak continued on Wednesday (July 22) when he graced the cover of Variety, which saw him dish on a multitude of topics, including his anticipated forthcoming album and first-look deal with Paramount Pictures.

